<title>USA: R.P. Scherer says shares up on block buy.</title>
<headline>R.P. Scherer says shares up on block buy.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>R.P. Scherer Corp said it was advised a single buyer acquired a block of about 42,000 common shares in the company Monday morning.</p>
<p>Scherer shares were up 1-3/4 to 58-3/8.</p>
<p>Trading in the stock was halted temporarily for an imbalance on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman said no announcements had been made. She said the block trade Monday morning equalled about half a normal day's trading in the stock.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
